  "_note": "Enemy kinds. hp and damage are multiplied by the spawn's strength factor (walls past the gate use passage.late_strength). aura_value feeds hidden latent aura on kill; bounty is cash. drops: unused since the Netherecho exists - constructs are subdued there, never looted. loot: item drops left on the ground, each rolled independently. shove_resist scales how far a shove moves this enemy: 1.0 light, 0.5 heavy, 0.25 elite - never zero. design/05 step 2: poise (see balance.combat); behaviour is melee | ranged | pouncer. A melee enemy may set attack_shape 'circle' (hits everything within attack_radius of itself when the wind-up ends), interruptible (a white flash; an interrupting skill or a poise break cancels it), stuck_after_miss (seconds it stands open after hitting nothing) and front_armour (share of damage it ignores from its front arc). ranged: holds between keep_range_min and max, aims for windup seconds along a line that stops following you aim_lock seconds before release, backs off if you come within back_off_within. pouncer: circles at circle_distance; when you have been moving away from the pack for pounce_after_retreat_s it crouches for windup and leaps pounce_range; any hit during the crouch or the leap knocks it down for knockdown_s; a leap that misses leaves it stuck.",
